OL,3,CFuneral for Oscar-winning singer &
OL,4,Csongwriter Glen Hansard to be held in
OL,5,CDublin
OL,7,FThe funeral is set to take place in
OL,8,FDublin on Tuesday for "trailblazer"
OL,9,FGlen Hansard.
OL,11,FThousands of mourners attended a
OL,12,Fpublic wake for the musician at the
OL,13,FBaroque Chapel at the Irish Museum of
OL,14,FModern Art at the Royal Hospital
OL,15,FKilmainham on Monday.
