OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1785847717
OL,3,CFuneral for Oscar-winning singer &
OL,4,Csongwriter Glen Hansard to be held in
OL,5,CDublin
OL,7,FThe frontman of the Irish band The
OL,8,FFrames was killed at the age of 56 in
OL,9,Fa motorcycle crash on the outskirts of
OL,10,FDublin last week, hours after taking
OL,11,Fpart in a trad session at The Wren's
OL,12,FNest pub.
OL,14,FHe had featured in celebrated film The
OL,15,FCommitments, and won an Oscar for best
OL,16,Foriginal song for Falling Slowly in
OL,17,F2008, which he co-wrote with Marketa
OL,18,FIrglova for the movie Once.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/3
