CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1785847717
OL,3,CFuneral for Oscar-winning singer &
OL,4,Csongwriter Glen Hansard to be held in
OL,5,CDublin
OL,7,FHe began an annual Christmas Eve
OL,8,Fcharity busk outside the Gaiety
OL,9,FTheatre 16 years ago, drawing members
OL,10,Fof the public to see famous Irish
OL,11,Fmusicians perform in aid of the
OL,12,Fhomeless in the city.
OL,14,FThe funeral service will take place at
OL,15,FSt Patrick's Cathedral at 1.30pm.
